Review replacing submitted `ce523f7` with `edc8e499` on PR #30761. This removes the receiver-merging approach and implements Carl’s requested UnionBuilder fix: `(str & ~AlwaysFalsy) | Literal[""]` becomes `str`. Nonempty fallbacks, additional intersection constraints and literal-string precision retain their existing handling.

For ordinary `str` annotations that include subclasses with a false-returning `__bool__`, this deliberately widens the modeled type; it is not an exact runtime-class claim.

Qualification passes all 532 maintained Markdown fixtures plus one temporary reviewer-case fixture, core 86, semantic 515 (35 ignored), IDE 1964, canonical hooks, formatting and strict Clippy. The temporary examples are not committed; network-backed modes were not separately qualified. [Qualification](https://app.buildbuddy.io/invocation/459a1ca0-d642-491d-970f-b35ccdbd261c).

