Review `6f413cc6`, replacing `31bf`. List and tuple displays now use the same sequence extraction as namedtuple, pytest and dynamic-class metadata. Metadata retains exact entries. Loops apply the existing 64-element promotion policy before joining those entries, uniformly for List and Tuple; explicitly annotated literals remain protected. Lazy root types, early stopping at unknown starred shapes, aliases and async recovery are retained.

