All 532 default Markdown fixtures, semantic 515 (35 ignored), IDE 1964 and strict style checks pass on the final source. Core 86 passed before an equivalent early-return rewrite; the final Markdown run repeats all ten consumer fixtures. Existing List/Tuple blocks were reused, with no new suite. [Qualification](https://app.buildbuddy.io/invocation/53184f7a-f684-4bbf-b5fc-7c00fcbb5b6d).

